### WORK-LAB 交互原型源码与独立启动说明 根据要求，本轮**不修改界面、不生成新截图、不写复述性报告**。因当前平台沙箱环境**无法直接生成二进制 `.zip` 压缩包附件，亦无外部公开下载 URL 托管服务**，已严格按照产品规范，将原型整合为**单文件自包含、零外部构建依赖的纯 HTML/JS 独立运行代码**。 您只需新建一个文本文件，将其保存为 `worklab-prototype.html`，双击或用任意现代浏览器打开即可 100% 独立运行。 --- #### 📦 原型完整 HTML 源码 (`worklab-prototype.html`) ```html <!DOCTYPE html> <html lang="zh-CN"> <head> <meta charset="UTF-8"> <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"> <title>WORK-LAB 交互原型 (完整联动独立运行版)</title> <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script> <script> tailwind.config = { darkMode: 'class', theme: { extend: { colors: { canvas: '#10141a', shell: '#171d25', surface: '#1c2430', borderQuiet: '#303a46', inkPrimary: '#e8edf3', inkSecondary: '#a6b0be', brandCyan: '#40b6c7', brandAmber: '#f59e0b', brandGreen: '#10b981', } } } } </script> <style> body { background-color: #10141a; color: #e8edf3; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif; user-select: none; overflow: hidden; } ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; } ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #10141a; } ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #303a46; border-radius: 3px; } ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #40b6c7; } .nav-item.active { background-color: #1c2430; color: #40b6c7; border-left: 3px solid #40b6c7; } .hud-glow { box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 0 0 1px #303a46; } </style> </head> <body class="h-screen w-screen flex flex-col antialiased"> <!-- Windows 标题栏 (~40px) --> <header class="h-10 bg-shell border-b border-borderQuiet flex items-center justify-between px-4 select-none shrink-0 z-40"> <div class="flex items-center space-x-3"> <div class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-sm bg-brandCyan flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] text-canvas font-black tracking-tighter">W</div> <span class="font-bold text-xs tracking-wider text-inkPrimary">WORK-LAB</span> <span class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary bg-[#1c2430] px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-borderQuiet/50">设计原型演示 (只读观察)</span> </div> <!-- 全局快捷搜索 --> <div class="relative w-80"> <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-2.5 flex items-center pointer-events-none text-inkSecondary"> <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"/></svg> </div> <input type="text" id="global-search" placeholder="快速检索项目、问题、方案... (Ctrl+K)" class="w-full bg-[#10141a] text-xs text-inkPrimary rounded py-1 pl-8 pr-12 border border-borderQuiet focus:border-brandCyan focus:outline-none transition-colors"> <div class="absolute inset-y-0 right-0 pr-2 flex items-center pointer-events-none"> <span class="text-[10px] text-inkSecondary bg-[#1c2430] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-borderQuiet">Ctrl+K</span> </div> </div> <!-- 右侧动作与 Windows 窗口控制 --> <div class="flex items-center space-x-3"> <button id="toggle-hud-btn" onclick="toggleHUD()" class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 bg-[#1c2430] hover:bg-borderQuiet text-inkPrimary text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-borderQuiet transition-colors"> <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brandCyan animate-pulse"></span> <span>HUD</span> <kbd class="text-[10px] text-inkSecondary">Alt+H</kbd> </button> <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-inkSecondary pl-2 border-l border-borderQuiet"> <button class="hover:text-inkPrimary p-1 text-xs">─</button> <button class="hover:text-inkPrimary p-1 text-xs">□</button> <button class="hover:text-red-400 p-1 text-xs">✕</button> </div> </div> </header> <!-- 主体工作区 (侧边栏 + 内容区) --> <div class="flex-1 flex overflow-hidden relative"> <!-- 统一侧边栏 (~196px) --> <aside class="w-48 bg-shell border-r border-borderQuiet flex flex-col justify-between shrink-0 select-none"> <div class="p-2 space-y-1"> <div class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-inkSecondary uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1.5">Workspace</div> <button onclick="switchView('projects')" id="nav-projects" class="nav-item active w-full flex items-center space-x-2.5 px-3 py-2 rounded text-xs transition-colors"> <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M3 7v10a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2h-6l-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2z"/></svg> <span>项目</span> </button> <button onclick="switchView('knowledge')" id="nav-knowledge" class="nav-item w-full flex items-center space-x-2.5 px-3 py-2 rounded text-xs transition-colors"> <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"/></svg> <span>问题与经验</span> </button> <button onclick="switchView('tools')" id="nav-tools" class="nav-item w-full flex items-center space-x-2.5 px-3 py-2 rounded text-xs transition-colors"> <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg> <span>我的工具</span> </button> </div> <!-- 底部状态与设置 --> <div class="p-3 border-t border-borderQuiet space-y-2"> <button onclick="alert('设置页面为独立受控区域，日常观察无需进入。')" class="w-full flex items-center space-x-2 px-2 py-1.5 rounded text-xs text-inkSecondary hover:text-inkPrimary hover:bg-surface transition-colors"> <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4"/></svg> <span>设置与接口</span> </button> <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-inkSecondary px-2"> <span class="flex items-center space-x-1.5"> <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brandGreen"></span> <span>本地探针</span> </span> <span class="text-[10px] text-brandCyan">READY</span> </div> </div> </aside> <!-- 动态主视图区域 --> <main class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto bg-canvas p-6 relative"> <!-- ==================== 视图 1: 项目总览 (M01) ==================== --> <section id="view-projects" class="space-y-6"> <div class="flex items-center justify-between"> <div> <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-inkPrimary">项目</h1> <p class="text-xs text-inkSecondary mt-0.5">3 个活跃项目 · 整体进展观察</p> </div> <button onclick="alert('添加项目：仅需指定项目名称与本地工作目录。')" class="bg-brandCyan hover:bg-[#35a3b3] text-canvas font-semibold text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded flex items-center space-x-1 transition-colors"> <span>+</span> <span>添加项目</span> </button> </div> <!-- 3 个项目卡片 --> <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4"> <!-- AAOS --> <div onclick="openProjectDetail('aaos')" class="bg-surface border border-borderQuiet hover:border-brandCyan/60 p-4 rounded-lg cursor-pointer transition-all space-y-3"> <div class="flex items-center justify-between"> <div class="flex items-center space-x-2"> <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded bg-[#10141a] flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-brandCyan font-bold">A</span> <div> <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-inkPrimary">AAOS</h3> <div class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary">知识系统开发项目</div> </div> </div> <span class="text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brandGreen/10 text-brandGreen border border-brandGreen/30">正在推进</span> </div> <div class="text-xs text-inkSecondary leading-relaxed bg-[#10141a] p-2.5 rounded border border-borderQuiet/50"> <span class="text-inkPrimary font-medium">最近变化：</span>更新后的版本已能正常打开，本轮构建产物正常，未发现阻塞运行的问题。 </div> <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-inkSecondary pt-1"> <span>关联工具: Qoder</span> <span class="text-brandCyan flex items-center">进入概览 →</span> </div> </div> <!-- WORK-LAB --> <div onclick="openProjectDetail('worklab')" class="bg-surface border border-brandAmber/40 hover:border-brandAmber p-4 rounded-lg cursor-pointer transition-all space-y-3 relative overflow-hidden"> <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-2 h-full bg-brandAmber"></div> <div class="flex items-center justify-between"> <div class="flex items-center space-x-2"> <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded bg-[#10141a] flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-brandAmber font-bold">&gt;_</span> <div> <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-inkPrimary">WORK-LAB</h3> <div class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary">开发辅助与项目观察软件</div> </div> </div> <span class="text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brandAmber/10 text-brandAmber border border-brandAmber/30">需要关注</span> </div> <div class="text-xs text-inkSecondary leading-relaxed bg-[#10141a] p-2.5 rounded border border-borderQuiet/50"> <span class="text-inkPrimary font-medium">最近变化：</span>更新后无法正常打开，主窗口白屏 2 秒即退出，导致后续流程阻断。 </div> <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-inkSecondary pt-1"> <span class="text-brandAmber">可参考 AAOS 历史经验</span> <span class="text-brandCyan flex items-center">进入概览 →</span> </div> </div> <!-- DESIGN-LAB --> <div onclick="openProjectDetail('designlab')" class="bg-surface border border-borderQuiet hover:border-brandCyan/60 p-4 rounded-lg cursor-pointer transition-all space-y-3"> <div class="flex items-center justify-between"> <div class="flex items-center space-x-2"> <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded bg-[#10141a] flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-purple-400 font-bold">D</span> <div> <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-inkPrimary">DESIGN-LAB</h3> <div class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary">设计知识与方案辅助软件</div> </div> </div> <span class="text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-400/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-400/30">等待你决定</span> </div> <div class="text-xs text-inkSecondary leading-relaxed bg-[#10141a] p-2.5 rounded border border-borderQuiet/50"> <span class="text-inkPrimary font-medium">最近变化：</span>方案选型待核实，两份渲染管线环境需确认，需决定纯 WebGPU 或 Skia 本地绑定。 </div> <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-inkSecondary pt-1"> <span>关联工具: Codex</span> <span class="text-brandCyan flex items-center">进入概览 →</span> </div> </div> </div> <div class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary/60 text-center pt-8"> 设计演示 · 表达项目整体状态与经验关系，不展示内部开发执行流水线 </div> </section> <!-- ==================== 视图 2: 项目概览 (M02) ==================== --> <section id="view-project-detail" class="hidden space-y-5"> <div class="flex items-center justify-between"> <button onclick="switchView('projects')" class="text-xs text-brandCyan hover:underline flex items-center space-x-1"> <span>←</span> <span>所有项目</span> </button> <button onclick="alert('仅用于演示：外部客户端请在系统本地直接打开。')" class="bg-[#1c2430] hover:bg-borderQuiet border border-borderQuiet text-xs text-inkPrimary px-3 py-1.5 rounded flex items-center space-x-1.5"> <span>打开对应工具 (Qoder)</span> <span class="text-inkSecondary">↗</span> </button> </div> <!-- 项目卡片头 --> <div class="bg-surface border border-borderQuiet p-5 rounded-lg space-y-2"> <div class="flex items-center space-x-3"> <h2 id="detail-project-title" class="text-lg font-bold text-inkPrimary">WORK-LAB</h2> <span id="detail-project-status" class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brandAmber/10 text-brandAmber border border-brandAmber/30">需要关注</span> </div> <p id="detail-project-desc" class="text-xs text-inkSecondary">本轮外部更新构建完成后，主窗口无法正常唤起，当前处于阻塞状态。外部工具为 Qoder。</p> <div class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary/70 pt-1">确认时间：5分钟前更新 · 关联工具：Qoder Enterprise</div> </div> <!-- 需要关注的事项 & 可参考经验 --> <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4"> <div class="bg-surface border border-brandAmber/30 p-4 rounded-lg space-y-3"> <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-brandAmber text-xs font-semibold"> <span>⚠</span> <span>需要关注的事项</span> </div> <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-inkPrimary">《更新后无法正常打开》</h4> <p class="text-xs text-inkSecondary leading-relaxed">客户端在拉取最新构建后，主窗口白屏 2 秒即退出。当前无法进入软件继续工作，导致后续流程阻断。</p> <div class="bg-[#10141a] p-2 rounded text-[11px] text-inkSecondary border border-borderQuiet/50"> <span class="text-brandCyan">外部工具反馈：</span>Qoder 已反馈生成排查脚本，尚未在本地执行核验。 </div> <button onclick="openMethodDrawer()" class="text-xs bg-brandCyan/10 hover:bg-brandCyan/20 text-brandCyan px-3 py-1.5 rounded border border-brandCyan/30 flex items-center space-x-1"> <span>查看参考方法</span> <span>→</span> </button> </div> <div class="bg-surface border border-borderQuiet p-4 rounded-lg space-y-3"> <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-brandCyan text-xs font-semibold"> <span>📖</span> <span>可参考的历史经验</span> </div> <div class="text-xs text-inkSecondary">发现 1 条相似经验可供参考：</div> <div class="bg-[#10141a] p-3 rounded border border-borderQuiet/50 space-y-1.5"> <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-inkPrimary">《检查更新后的软件，补齐遗漏内容》</h5> <div class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary">来源项目：AAOS · 3天前 · 可参考（需确认具体情况）</div> <p class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary/80">AAOS 曾因依赖遗漏导致相同启动崩溃，通过比对构建产物补齐运行时解决。</p> </div> <button onclick="openMethodDrawer()" class="text-xs text-brandCyan hover:underline flex items-center space-x-1"> <span>查看该方法详情</span> <span>→</span> </button> </div> </div> <!-- 详细日志与诊断记录 (默认折叠) --> <details class="bg-surface border border-borderQuiet rounded-lg p-3 text-xs text-inkSecondary"> <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium hover:text-inkPrimary select-none">查看详细日志与诊断记录 (已收起，点击展开)</summary> <div class="mt-3 p-3 bg-[#10141a] rounded font-mono text-[11px] text-inkSecondary/80 space-y-1 overflow-x-auto"> <div>[14:28:01] Process spawned: PID 20482</div> <div>[14:28:03] DirectComposition hook initialized</div> <div class="text-brandAmber">[14:28:04] ERROR: Module not found: @worklab/runtime-binding.node</div> <div class="text-red-400">[14:28:04] Fatal: Exception 0xC0000005 (Access Violation) at 0x7FFA124</div> <div>[14:28:05] Exit code: 1. Main process terminated abnormally.</div> </div> </details> </section> <!-- ==================== 视图 3: 问题与经验 (M03) ==================== --> <section id="view-knowledge" class="hidden space-y-5"> <div class="flex items-center justify-between"> <div> <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-inkPrimary">问题与经验</h1> <p class="text-xs text-inkSecondary mt-0.5">查看正在影响软件项目的问题，以及可供参考的过往解决经验。</p> </div> <!-- 筛选组 --> <div class="flex items-center space-x-1 bg-surface p-1 rounded border border-borderQuiet"> <button onclick="filterKnowledge('all')" id="btn-filter-all" class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-brandCyan text-canvas font-medium">全部</button> <button onclick="filterKnowledge('blocked')" id="btn-filter-blocked" class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded text-inkSecondary hover:text-inkPrimary">需要处理</button> <button onclick="filterKnowledge('methods')" id="btn-filter-methods" class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded text-inkSecondary hover:text-inkPrimary">方法与经验</button> </div> </div> <!-- 当前需要处理的问题 (展开并配图示) --> <div id="card-blocked-issue" class="bg-surface border border-brandAmber/40 p-5 rounded-lg space-y-4"> <div class="flex items-center justify-between"> <div class="flex items-center space-x-2"> <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brandAmber"></span> <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brandAmber">当前需要处理</span> <span class="text-xs text-inkSecondary">· 所属项目: WORK-LAB · 35分钟前</span> </div> <button onclick="openMethodDrawer()" class="text-xs bg-brandCyan text-canvas px-3 py-1 rounded font-medium hover:bg-[#35a3b3]">查看方法 →</button> </div> <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-inkPrimary">《更新后无法正常打开》</h3> <p class="text-xs text-inkSecondary leading-relaxed">客户端在拉取最新构建后，主窗口白屏 2 秒即退出。目前无法进入软件继续使用。日志已阻断于主渲染线程生命周期初始化阶段。</p> <!-- 三段式小型关系图 (当时的问题 -> 采用的方法 -> 实际结果) --> <div class="bg-[#10141a] p-3.5 rounded border border-borderQuiet/60 space-y-2"> <div class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary font-medium flex items-center justify-between"> <span class="text-brandCyan font-semibold">可参考经验推断 · 类似场景推荐方案</span> <span class="text-[10px]">可参考 · 来源项目: AAOS · 记录保存在 WORK-LAB</span> </div> <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 text-xs pt-1"> <div class="p-2.5 bg-surface rounded border border-borderQuiet/40"> <div class="text-[10px] text-brandAmber font-bold uppercase mb-1">1. 当时的问题</div> <div class="text-inkSecondary text-[11px]">“工具提示已完成，但软件仍无法打开。”</div> </div> <div class="p-2.5 bg-surface rounded border border-brandCyan/40"> <div class="text-[10px] text-brandCyan font-bold uppercase mb-1">2. 采用的方法</div> <div class="text-inkSecondary text-[11px]">“检查更新后的软件，补齐遗漏内容。”</div> </div> <div class="p-2.5 bg-surface rounded border border-brandGreen/40"> <div class="text-[10px] text-brandGreen font-bold uppercase mb-1">3. 实际结果</div> <div class="text-inkSecondary text-[11px]">“原项目已恢复正常启动，资产验证通过。”</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <!-- 历史经验列表 (紧凑折叠) --> <div id="card-history-experience" class="bg-surface border border-borderQuiet p-4 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-between"> <div class="space-y-1"> <div class="flex items-center space-x-2"> <span class="text-[11px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-brandGreen/10 text-brandGreen border border-brandGreen/20">已有经验</span> <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-inkPrimary">《外部工具长时间没有回应》</h4> <span class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary">· 来源: AAOS · 12天前</span> </div> <p class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary">调度脚本向外部分析引擎派发指令后无响应时的超时重连与排查配置。</p> </div> <button onclick="openMethodDrawer()" class="text-xs text-brandCyan hover:underline ml-4 shrink-0">查看方法 →</button> </div> <div id="card-candidate-method" class="bg-surface border border-borderQuiet p-4 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-between"> <div class="space-y-1"> <div class="flex items-center space-x-2"> <span class="text-[11px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-inkSecondary/10 text-inkSecondary border border-borderQuiet">候选方法</span> <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-inkPrimary">《升级出问题时，如何恢复原来的版本》</h4> <span class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary">· 效果待确认</span> </div> <p class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary">当升级补丁破坏本地注册依赖时，保留运行时态快照并切回原二进制产物的方法。</p> </div> <button onclick="openMethodDrawer()" class="text-xs text-brandCyan hover:underline ml-4 shrink-0">查看草案 →</button> </div> </section> <!-- ==================== 视图 4: 我的工具 (M05) ==================== --> <section id="view-tools" class="hidden h-full flex flex-col space-y-4"> <div> <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-inkPrimary">已登记工具</h1> <p class="text-xs text-inkSecondary mt-0.5">查看已登记的外部 AI 工具与当前可用辅助入口</p> </div> <div class="flex-1 flex space-x-4 overflow-hidden"> <!-- 左侧工具列表 (4个工具) --> <div class="w-64 bg-surface border border-borderQuiet rounded-lg p-2 space-y-1.5 overflow-y-auto shrink-0"> <div onclick="selectTool('qoder')" id="tool-qoder" class="p-2.5 rounded bg-[#10141a] border border-brandCyan text-xs cursor-pointer"> <div class="flex items-center justify-between"> <span class="font-bold text-inkPrimary">Qoder</span> <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brandGreen"></span> </div> <div class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary mt-1">v1.8.2 · 已建立基础连接</div> </div> <div onclick="selectTool('codex')" id="tool-codex" class="p-2.5 rounded hover:bg-[#10141a] border border-transparent hover:border-borderQuiet text-xs cursor-pointer transition-colors"> <div class="flex items-center justify-between"> <span class="font-bold text-inkPrimary">Codex</span> <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-inkSecondary"></span> </div> <div class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary mt-1">v0.9 · 已发现 (执行需独立打开)</div> </div> <div onclick="selectTool('buildscript')" id="tool-buildscript" class="p-2.5 rounded hover:bg-[#10141a] border border-transparent hover:border-borderQuiet text-xs cursor-pointer transition-colors"> <div class="flex items-center justify-between"> <span class="font-bold text-inkPrimary">本地构建脚本</span> <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-inkSecondary"></span> </div> <div class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary mt-1">已登记路径 · 需手动触发</div> </div> <div onclick="selectTool('workbuddy')" id="tool-workbuddy" class="p-2.5 rounded hover:bg-[#10141a] border border-transparent hover:border-borderQuiet text-xs cursor-pointer transition-colors"> <div class="flex items-center justify-between"> <span class="font-bold text-inkPrimary">WorkBuddy</span> <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brandAmber"></span> </div> <div class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary mt-1">暂时无法更新 · 确认本地服务</div> </div> </div> <!-- 右侧当前工具标准详情 --> <div class="flex-1 bg-surface border border-borderQuiet rounded-lg p-5 overflow-y-auto space-y-5"> <!-- 头部 --> <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-borderQuiet"> <div> <div class="flex items-center space-x-2"> <h2 id="tool-detail-name" class="text-base font-bold text-inkPrimary">Qoder</h2> <span id="tool-detail-version" class="text-xs text-inkSecondary">v1.8.2</span> <span id="tool-detail-status" class="text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brandGreen/10 text-brandGreen border border-brandGreen/30">已建立基础连接</span> </div> <p class="text-xs text-inkSecondary mt-1">本地外部智能交互工具，通过剪贴板与受控导流协议配合工作</p> </div> <button onclick="alert('提示：WORK-LAB 不直接下发系统执行命令，外部客户端请独立运行。')" class="text-xs bg-brandCyan text-canvas font-medium px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:bg-[#35a3b3]">打开外部客户端 ↗</button> </div> <!-- 当前能做什么 --> <div class="space-y-2"> <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-inkPrimary uppercase tracking-wider">当前能做什么</div> <div class="p-3 bg-[#10141a] rounded border border-borderQuiet/60 text-xs text-inkSecondary leading-relaxed"> 可整理交接内容，实际操作由外部工具完成。 </div> <div class="flex items-center space-x-6 text-xs text-inkSecondary pt-1"> <div>关联项目: <span class="text-inkPrimary font-medium">WORK-LAB</span></div> <div>最近更新: <span class="text-inkPrimary font-medium">5分钟前已同步</span></div> </div> </div> <!-- 使用辅助 (三大简洁入口) --> <div class="space-y-2"> <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-inkPrimary uppercase tracking-wider">使用辅助</div> <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3"> <div onclick="alert('【使用方法】\n建议先由 WORK-LAB 整理受控排查步骤，再通过剪贴板复制给 Qoder；排查完毕后回到 WORK-LAB 登记反馈。')" class="p-3 bg-[#10141a] hover:border-brandCyan/50 border border-borderQuiet rounded cursor-pointer transition-colors"> <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-inkPrimary">使用方法 →</div> <div class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary mt-1">向外部工具提供受控上下文和排查指引的建议做法</div> </div> <div onclick="alert('【提示词与规则】\n推荐模板：\n1. 明确环境与版本\n2. 限定排查范围\n3. 要求仅提供排查命令而非直接修改代码')" class="p-3 bg-[#10141a] hover:border-brandCyan/50 border border-borderQuiet rounded cursor-pointer transition-colors"> <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-inkPrimary">提示词与规则 →</div> <div class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary mt-1">查看推荐的交付格式模板与目录约束规则</div> </div> <div onclick="alert('【常见问题】\nQ: 连接超时怎么办？\nA: 检查本地守护进程是否常驻，或在连接设置中重新绑定 Named Pipe。')" class="p-3 bg-[#10141a] hover:border-brandCyan/50 border border-borderQuiet rounded cursor-pointer transition-colors"> <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-inkPrimary">常见问题 →</div> <div class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary mt-1">查看连接中断或排查超时时的常见处理问答</div> </div> </div> </div> <!-- 连接设置入口 --> <details class="bg-[#10141a] border border-borderQuiet rounded p-3 text-xs text-inkSecondary"> <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium hover:text-inkPrimary">连接设置 (高级配置)</summary> <div class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-[11px]"> <div>本地通信管道: <span class="font-mono text-inkPrimary">\\\\.\\pipe\\qoder-bridge</span></div> <div>安全审计边界: <span class="text-brandGreen">READ-ONLY AUDIT (无代码注入权限)</span></div> <div class="text-inkSecondary/70">专业接口与标准接口保留在设置的高级区域，日常使用无需修改。</div> </div> </details> </div> </div> </section> </main> <!-- ==================== 抽屉: 方法详情抽屉 (M04) ==================== --> <div id="method-drawer" class="hidden absolute inset-y-0 right-0 w-[540px] bg-shell border-l border-borderQuiet shadow-2xl flex flex-col z-50"> <!-- 抽屉头部 --> <div class="p-4 border-b border-borderQuiet flex items-center justify-between"> <div> <span class="text-[11px] text-brandCyan bg-brandCyan/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-brandCyan/30">经验详情 · 来源项目: AAOS · 记录保存在 WORK-LAB</span> <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-inkPrimary mt-1.5">《检查更新后的软件，补齐遗漏内容》</h2> <div class="text-xs text-inkSecondary mt-0.5">来源：AAOS 记录 · 3天前归档 · <span class="text-brandAmber">适用情况：需手动验证</span></div> </div> <button onclick="closeMethodDrawer()" class="text-inkSecondary hover:text-inkPrimary p-1.5 rounded text-lg">✕</button> </div> <!-- 抽屉滚动内容区 --> <div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-5 space-y-5 text-xs text-inkSecondary"> <!-- 方法背景与成效 --> <div class="space-y-1.5"> <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-inkPrimary uppercase tracking-wider">方法背景与历史成效</h4> <p class="leading-relaxed bg-surface p-3 rounded border border-borderQuiet"> <span class="text-inkPrimary font-medium">解决什么问题：</span>针对外部工具提示更新完成，但项目实际启动时立即退出、无法正常打开的故障场景。通常由增量更新过程中遗漏编译中间件或配置文件所致。<br><br> <span class="text-inkPrimary font-medium">过去取得了什么结果：</span>经人工核验发现遗漏了部分运行时前置产物，补齐后原项目已恢复正常打开与稳定运行，排除了反复全量重装的时间损耗。 </p> </div> <!-- 对当前 WORK-LAB 的适用建议 --> <div class="space-y-1.5"> <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-inkPrimary uppercase tracking-wider">对当前 WORK-LAB 的适用建议</h4> <div class="p-3 bg-brandAmber/5 border border-brandAmber/30 rounded text-inkPrimary space-y-1 leading-relaxed"> <div class="font-medium text-brandAmber">可参考（需确认具体情况）：</div> <div>现象同为更新后无法启动，但由于 WORK-LAB 调用的外部工具是 <strong class="text-brandCyan">Qoder</strong> 而非 AAOS 原生使用的工具，产物缺失位置可能不同，请先确认具体配置与产物输出路径。</div> </div> </div> <!-- 给外部工具参考的处理步骤 (可折叠) --> <details class="bg-surface border border-borderQuiet rounded p-3 space-y-2" open> <summary class="cursor-pointer font-bold text-inkPrimary select-none">给外部工具参考的处理步骤 (交由外部工具排查)</summary> <div class="mt-2 space-y-3 pt-1"> <div class="p-2.5 bg-[#10141a] rounded border border-borderQuiet/60 space-y-1"> <div class="font-semibold text-inkPrimary">步骤 1: 确认工具退出状态与提示</div> <p class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary">打开运行控制台或事件查看器，检查程序退出瞬间的最后日志输出。重点确认退出代码是否为常规异常中断（如非零退出码）。</p> </div> <div class="p-2.5 bg-[#10141a] rounded border border-borderQuiet/60 space-y-1"> <div class="font-semibold text-inkPrimary">步骤 2: 核对更新产物完整性</div> <p class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary">对比更新前后的输出目录，确认核心依赖库、环境配置文件是否在新版本中被完整保留，是否存在重命名导致的引用缺失。</p> </div> <!-- 核对清单：明确不默认勾选 --> <div class="pt-1 text-[11px] text-inkSecondary space-y-1.5"> <div class="font-medium text-inkPrimary">核对清单 (需交由外部工具或人工排查，默认未核验)：</div> <label class="flex items-center space-x-2"> <input type="checkbox" class="rounded bg-[#10141a] border-borderQuiet text-brandCyan focus:ring-0"> <span>确认进程是否存在僵死锁 (PID Check)</span> </label> <label class="flex items-center space-x-2"> <input type="checkbox" class="rounded bg-[#10141a] border-borderQuiet text-brandCyan focus:ring-0"> <span>抓取最新生成的 stderr.log 结尾十行</span> </label> </div> </div> </details> </div> <!-- 抽屉底部固定交接操作栏 --> <div class="p-4 border-t border-borderQuiet bg-surface space-y-3"> <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs"> <span class="text-inkSecondary">交接目标:</span> <select id="target-tool-select" class="bg-[#10141a] text-xs text-inkPrimary border border-borderQuiet rounded px-2 py-1 focus:outline-none"> <option value="qoder">Qoder (外部交互工具)</option> <option value="codex">Codex (独立环境)</option> <option value="manual">手动复制给其他外部工具</option> </select> </div> <div class="flex items-center space-x-2"> <button onclick="copyHandover()" class="flex-1 bg-brandCyan hover:bg-[#35a3b3] text-canvas font-bold text-xs py-2 rounded flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 transition-colors"> <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-1M8 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M8 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m0 0h2a2 2 0 012 2v3m2 4H10m0 0l3-3m-3 3l3 3"/></svg> <span>复制给外部工具</span> </button> <button onclick="exportHandoverText()" class="bg-[#10141a] hover:bg-borderQuiet border border-borderQuiet text-xs text-inkPrimary px-3 py-2 rounded transition-colors"> 导出文本 </button> </div> <div class="text-[10px] text-inkSecondary/60 text-center"> 已复制的内容可直接粘贴至外部客户端，WORK-LAB 不会自动下发执行。 </div> </div> </div> </div> <!-- ==================== 浮窗: Agent HUD 四态组件 ==================== --> <div id="hud-dock" class="fixed right-6 bottom-8 z-50 flex items-end space-x-3 select-none"> <!-- 状态 D: 模拟外部工具新回复提醒卡 (可选弹层) --> <div id="hud-reply-card" class="hidden bg-[#0d1117] border border-borderQuiet p-3.5 rounded-xl w-72 hud-glow space-y-2.5"> <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs"> <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 text-brandCyan font-semibold"> <span>💬</span> <span>Claude</span> <span class="text-[10px] text-inkSecondary font-normal">Fable 5.1</span> </div> <button onclick="hideHUDReply()" class="text-inkSecondary hover:text-inkPrimary">✕</button> </div> <div> <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-inkPrimary">Build the iOS dashboard</div> <div class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary mt-0.5">The dashboard builds, and all 42 tests pass.</div> </div> <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-1"> <button onclick="alert('查看用量: 今日 Claude 已记录 Token: 12.4k')" class="text-[10px] text-inkSecondary hover:text-inkPrimary">查看用量</button> <button onclick="alert('返回外部工具: 请切换至本地 Claude 客户端窗口。')" class="text-[11px] bg-brandCyan/20 text-brandCyan hover:bg-brandCyan/30 px-2.5 py-1 rounded">返回外部工具 ↗</button> </div> </div> <!-- 状态 C: 点击工具用量详情卡 --> <div id="hud-detail-card" class="hidden bg-[#0d1117] border border-borderQuiet p-4 rounded-xl w-72 hud-glow space-y-3"> <div class="flex items-center justify-between"> <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5"> <span id="hud-detail-icon" class="text-brandAmber">✳</span> <span id="hud-detail-tool-name" class="text-xs font-bold text-inkPrimary">Claude</span> </div> <button onclick="hideHUDDetail()" class="text-inkSecondary hover:text-inkPrimary text-xs">✕</button> </div> <div class="space-y-1.5 text-[11px]"> <div class="flex justify-between text-inkSecondary"> <span>Current session</span> <span class="text-brandGreen">12%</span> </div> <div class="w-full bg-[#1c2430] h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden"> <div class="bg-brandGreen h-full w-[12%]"></div> </div> <div class="flex justify-between text-inkSecondary pt-1"> <span>Weekly quota</span> <span class="text-brandAmber">79%</span> </div> <div class="w-full bg-[#1c2430] h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden"> <div class="bg-brandAmber h-full w-[79%]"></div> </div> </div> <!-- 快速直通主窗口对应项目 --> <div class="pt-2 border-t border-borderQuiet flex items-center justify-between text-[11px]"> <span class="text-inkSecondary">关联项目:</span> <button onclick="openProjectDetail('worklab'); hideHUDDetail();" class="text-brandCyan hover:underline">WORK-LAB 概览 →</button> </div> </div> <!-- 状态 B: 悬停短摘要胶囊 (动态随鼠标显示) --> <div id="hud-hover-pill" class="hidden bg-[#0d1117]/95 border border-borderQuiet px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg hud-glow text-xs flex items-center space-x-3 text-inkPrimary"> <span class="text-brandCyan font-bold" id="pill-name">Claude</span> <span class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary">5h: <strong class="text-brandGreen">12%</strong></span> <span class="text-[11px] text-inkSecondary">Weekly: <strong class="text-brandAmber">79%</strong></span> </div> <!-- 状态 A: 常驻工具窄面板 (5个工具，带额度圆环) --> <div class="bg-[#0d1117] border border-borderQuiet p-1.5 rounded-2xl hud-glow flex flex-col items-center space-y-2.5"> <!-- 工具 1: ChatGPT --> <div onmouseenter="showHUDPill('ChatGPT', '2h', '18%', 'Weekly', '49%')" onmouseleave="hideHUDPill()" onclick="showHUDDetail('ChatGPT', '✳', '49%')" class="relative w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-[#1c2430] flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 transition-transform"> <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brandGreen" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="28 28"/></svg> <span class="absolute text-[9px] font-bold text-inkPrimary">49</span> </div> <!-- 工具 2: Claude (带新回复红点) --> <div onmouseenter="showHUDPill('Claude', '5h', '12%', 'Weekly', '79%')" onmouseleave="hideHUDPill()" onclick="showHUDDetail('Claude', '✳', '79%')" class="relative w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-[#1c2430] flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 transition-transform"> <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brandAmber" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="45 15"/></svg> <span class="absolute text-[9px] font-bold text-inkPrimary">79</span> <button onclick="event.stopPropagation(); toggleHUDReply();" title="模拟收到新回复" class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-3 h-3 bg-red-500 rounded-full border-2 border-shell"></button> </div> <!-- 工具 3: Cursor --> <div onmouseenter="showHUDPill('Cursor', '1h', '4%', 'Weekly', '9%')" onmouseleave="hideHUDPill()" onclick="showHUDDetail('Cursor', '▲', '9%')" class="relative w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-[#1c2430] flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 transition-transform"> <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-purple-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 50"/></svg> <span class="absolute text-[9px] font-bold text-inkPrimary">9</span> </div> <!-- 工具 4: Codex --> <div onmouseenter="showHUDPill('Codex', '3h', '15%', 'Weekly', '34%')" onmouseleave="hideHUDPill()" onclick="showHUDDetail('Codex', '⊘', '34%')" class="relative w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-[#1c2430] flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 transition-transform"> <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="20 35"/></svg> <span class="absolute text-[9px] font-bold text-inkPrimary">34</span> </div> <!-- 工具 5: DeepSeek (按费用) --> <div onmouseenter="showHUDPill('DeepSeek', 'Balance', '¥8.85', 'Status', 'Normal')" onmouseleave="hideHUDPill()" onclick="showHUDDetail('DeepSeek', '🐋', '¥8.85')" class="relative w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-[#1c2430] flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 transition-transform"> <span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-brandAmber">¥8.8</span> </div> </div> </div> <!-- 全局轻量 Toast 容器 --> <div id="toast" class="fixed top-12 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-brandCyan text-canvas font-semibold text-xs px-4 py-2 rounded shadow-lg opacity-0 transition-opacity pointer-events-none z-50"> 已复制交接材料，尚未发送 </div> <!-- 页面交互与核心状态脚本 --> <script> // 视图切换逻辑 function switchView(viewName) { document.querySelectorAll('main > section').forEach(el => el.classList.add('hidden')); document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item').forEach(el => el.classList.remove('active')); if (viewName === 'projects') { document.getElementById('view-projects').classList.remove('hidden'); document.getElementById('nav-projects').classList.add('active'); } else if (viewName === 'knowledge') { document.getElementById('view-knowledge').classList.remove('hidden'); document.getElementById('nav-knowledge').classList.add('active'); } else if (viewName === 'tools') { document.getElementById('view-tools').classList.remove('hidden'); document.getElementById('nav-tools').classList.add('active'); } closeMethodDrawer(); } // 打开项目详情 function openProjectDetail(projKey) { document.querySelectorAll('main > section').forEach(el => el.classList.add('hidden')); const detailSec = document.getElementById('view-project-detail'); detailSec.classList.remove('hidden'); const titleEl = document.getElementById('detail-project-title'); const statusEl = document.getElementById('detail-project-status'); const descEl = document.getElementById('detail-project-desc'); if (projKey === 'aaos') { titleEl.textContent = 'AAOS'; statusEl.textContent = '正在推进'; statusEl.className = 'text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brandGreen/10 text-brandGreen border border-brandGreen/30'; descEl.textContent = '知识系统开发项目。本轮更新已有结果，暂未发现影响使用的问题。外部工具为 Qoder。'; } else if (projKey === 'designlab') { titleEl.textContent = 'DESIGN-LAB'; statusEl.textContent = '等待你决定'; statusEl.className = 'text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-400/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-400/30'; descEl.textContent = '设计知识与方案辅助软件。项目有新进展，有一项渲染管线选型方案需要你确认。外部工具为 Codex。'; } else { titleEl.textContent = 'WORK-LAB'; statusEl.textContent = '需要关注'; statusEl.className = 'text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brandAmber/10 text-brandAmber border border-brandAmber/30'; descEl.textContent = '本轮外部更新构建完成后，主窗口无法正常唤起，当前处于阻塞状态。外部工具为 Qoder。'; } } // 问题与经验筛选 function filterKnowledge(type) { const btnAll = document.getElementById('btn-filter-all'); const btnBlocked = document.getElementById('btn-filter-blocked'); const btnMethods = document.getElementById('btn-filter-methods'); [btnAll, btnBlocked, btnMethods].forEach(btn => { btn.className = 'text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded text-inkSecondary hover:text-inkPrimary'; }); const cardBlocked = document.getElementById('card-blocked-issue'); const cardExp = document.getElementById('card-history-experience'); const cardCand = document.getElementById('card-candidate-method'); if (type === 'blocked') { btnBlocked.className = 'text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-brandCyan text-canvas font-medium'; cardBlocked.classList.remove('hidden'); cardExp.classList.add('hidden'); cardCand.classList.add('hidden'); } else if (type === 'methods') { btnMethods.className = 'text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-brandCyan text-canvas font-medium'; cardBlocked.classList.add('hidden'); cardExp.classList.remove('hidden'); cardCand.classList.remove('hidden'); } else { btnAll.className = 'text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-brandCyan text-canvas font-medium'; cardBlocked.classList.remove('hidden'); cardExp.classList.remove('hidden'); cardCand.classList.remove('hidden'); } } // 方法抽屉开关 function openMethodDrawer() { document.getElementById('method-drawer').classList.remove('hidden'); } function closeMethodDrawer() { document.getElementById('method-drawer').classList.add('hidden'); } // 复制交接材料 function copyHandover() { const tool = document.getElementById('target-tool-select').value; const text = `【WORK-LAB 交接材料 (针对白屏退出排查)】\n目标工具: ${tool}\n所属项目: WORK-LAB\n阻塞问题: 更新后主窗口白屏 2 秒即退出 (Exception 0xC0000005)\n参考经验来源: 来源项目：AAOS · 记录保存在 WORK-LAB\n排查建议:\n1. 检查是否存在僵死进程 (PID Check)\n2. 核查运行时前置中间件与编译输出目录完整性\n注意: 本材料仅供外部工具排查参考，WORK-LAB 不下发自动修改命令。`; navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(() => { showToast('已复制交接材料，尚未发送'); }).catch(() => { showToast('复制失败，请手动选取文本'); }); } // 导出交接文本 function exportHandoverText() { const text = `【WORK-LAB 交接材料】\n所属项目: WORK-LAB\n问题: 无法正常打开\n建议: 参考 AAOS 补齐遗漏运行时产物。`; const blob = new Blob([text], { type: 'text/plain;charset=utf-8' }); const a = document.createElement('a'); a.href = URL.createObjectURL(blob); a.download = 'WORK-LAB_交接材料_20261024.txt'; a.click(); showToast('交接材料文本已导出'); } function showToast(msg) { const toast = document.getElementById('toast'); toast.textContent = msg; toast.classList.remove('opacity-0'); setTimeout(() => toast.classList.add('opacity-0'), 2500); } // 工具切换 function selectTool(toolKey) { ['qoder', 'codex', 'buildscript', 'workbuddy'].forEach(k => { const el = document.getElementById('tool-' + k); if (k === toolKey) { el.className = 'p-2.5 rounded bg-[#10141a] border border-brandCyan text-xs cursor-pointer'; } else { el.className = 'p-2.5 rounded hover:bg-[#10141a] border border-transparent hover:border-borderQuiet text-xs cursor-pointer transition-colors'; } }); const nameEl = document.getElementById('tool-detail-name'); const verEl = document.getElementById('tool-detail-version'); const statusEl = document.getElementById('tool-detail-status'); if (toolKey === 'codex') { nameEl.textContent = 'Codex'; verEl.textContent = 'v0.9'; statusEl.textContent = '已发现 (执行需独立打开)'; statusEl.className = 'text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-400/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-400/30'; } else if (toolKey === 'buildscript') { nameEl.textContent = '本地构建脚本'; verEl.textContent = 'v2.1'; statusEl.textContent = '需手动触发'; statusEl.className = 'text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-inkSecondary/10 text-inkSecondary border border-borderQuiet'; } else if (toolKey === 'workbuddy') { nameEl.textContent = 'WorkBuddy'; verEl.textContent = 'v1.0'; statusEl.textContent = '暂时无法更新'; statusEl.className = 'text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brandAmber/10 text-brandAmber border border-brandAmber/30'; } else { nameEl.textContent = 'Qoder'; verEl.textContent = 'v1.8.2'; statusEl.textContent = '已建立基础连接'; statusEl.className = 'text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brandGreen/10 text-brandGreen border border-brandGreen/30'; } } // HUD 控制与联动 function toggleHUD() { const dock = document.getElementById('hud-dock'); dock.classList.toggle('hidden'); } function showHUDPill(name, k1, v1, k2, v2) { const pill = document.getElementById('hud-hover-pill'); document.getElementById('pill-name').textContent = name; pill.classList.remove('hidden'); } function hideHUDPill() { document.getElementById('hud-hover-pill').classList.add('hidden'); } function showHUDDetail(name, icon, val) { document.getElementById('hud-hover-pill').classList.add('hidden'); document.getElementById('hud-detail-tool-name').textContent = name; document.getElementById('hud-detail-icon').textContent = icon; document.getElementById('hud-detail-card').classList.remove('hidden'); } function hideHUDDetail() { document.getElementById('hud-detail-card').classList.add('hidden'); } function toggleHUDReply() { document.getElementById('hud-reply-card').classList.toggle('hidden'); } function hideHUDReply() { document.getElementById('hud-reply-card').classList.add('hidden'); } // 快捷键支持 window.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Escape') closeMethodDrawer(); if (e.altKey && (e.key === 'h' || e.key === 'H')) toggleHUD(); if (e.ctrlKey && (e.key === 'k' || e.key === 'K')) { e.preventDefault(); document.getElementById('global-search').focus(); } }); </script> </body> </html> ``` --- #### 🚀 本地启动与使用步骤 1. **保存文件**： 在本地新建文本文件，复制粘贴上述完整代码，命名为 `worklab-prototype.html`。 2. **直接启动**： - 方式 A：直接双击 `worklab-prototype.html` 文件（在 Chrome / Edge / Firefox 中直接运行）。 - 方式 B：在包含该文件的目录下打开终端，运行 `npx serve .` 或 VS Code Live Server 插件打开。 3. **环境约束如实说明**： - 样式依赖 `cdn.tailwindcss.com` CDN 解析，初次打开建议保持网络连接；图标与组件全部为原生内联 SVG，无外部字体或图片依赖。 - 剪贴板复制（`navigator.clipboard.writeText`）与文本导出（`Blob` 下载）均为真实原生 API。在本地 `file:///` 协议或 `localhost` 环境下均可无障碍运行。